Dialogue: 6,0:00:06.28,0:00:09.61,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ねぇホントに頑張ってるわね
Dialogue: 6,0:00:09.61,0:00:10.91,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,すごいわよ
Dialogue: 6,0:00:10.91,0:00:13.45,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,もう私もうれしくなっちゃう
Dialogue: 6,0:00:14.37,0:00:16.20,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,めちゃくちゃ応援しちゃう
Dialogue: 6,0:00:16.50,0:00:18.83,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,インターハイまでに力つけないと
Dialogue: 6,0:00:18.83,0:00:20.04,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,今日はごちそうね
Dialogue: 6,0:00:20.04,0:00:21.79,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ありがとうございます
Dialogue: 6,0:00:23.00,0:00:24.21,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,よかった
Dialogue: 6,0:00:26.05,0:00:28.68,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,千夏先輩インターハイ決めたんだ
Dialogue: 6,0:00:29.18,0:00:30.39,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,よかった
Dialogue: 6,0:00:30.97,0:00:32.43,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,よかった
Dialogue: 6,0:00:33.14,0:00:36.22,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,すげえすげえよ
Dialogue: 6,0:00:36.22,0:00:38.64,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,有言実行させちゃうんだ
Dialogue: 6,0:00:38.98,0:00:40.48,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,かっこよすぎる
Dialogue: 6,0:00:46.11,0:00:47.11,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,なのに…
Dialogue: 6,0:00:49.49,0:00:50.20,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,イン
Dialogue: 6,0:00:50.91,0:00:54.66,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ゲーム21-1121-13
Dialogue: 6,0:00:55.66,0:00:58.33,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,佐知川高校遊佐君
Dialogue: 6,0:01:03.38,0:01:04.38,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,なのに
Dialogue: 6,0:01:07.34,0:01:08.34,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,なのに
Dialogue: 6,0:01:12.34,0:01:13.34,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,だけど
Dialogue: 6,0:01:23.15,0:01:24.48,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,俺は負けた
Dialogue: 6,0:03:07.58,0:03:09.04,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,早く
Dialogue: 6,0:03:09.04,0:03:10.04,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,待ってよ
Dialogue: 6,0:03:10.04,0:03:11.38,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,遅いぞ
Dialogue: 6,0:03:34.65,0:03:36.07,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,もう無理だ
Dialogue: 6,0:03:37.70,0:03:39.16,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,限界なんだ
Dialogue: 6,0:03:40.28,0:03:42.12,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,俺は諦めるしかない
Dialogue: 6,0:03:44.41,0:03:46.66,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,期末試験なんて
Dialogue: 6,0:03:48.29,0:03:51.59,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,なんで大会明けすぐにテストなんだよ
Dialogue: 6,0:03:52.25,0:03:54.55,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,だからこつこつやれって
Dialogue: 6,0:03:55.09,0:03:56.47,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,部活行くぞ
Dialogue: 6,0:03:56.80,0:04:00.68,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,こつこつやるっていうのが一番難しいんだよ
Dialogue: 6,0:04:00.68,0:04:02.85,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,簡単に言うけどね君
Dialogue: 6,0:04:03.43,0:04:05.60,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,分からないだろうね
Dialogue: 6,0:04:05.60,0:04:07.48,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,やさぐれてんな
Dialogue: 6,0:04:14.15,0:04:15.15,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,お待たせ
Dialogue: 6,0:04:15.15,0:04:16.57,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,うんお疲れ
Dialogue: 6,0:04:17.45,0:04:19.49,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,コンクールどの部門で出る
Dialogue: 6,0:04:19.49,0:04:21.66,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,僕は朗読かな
Dialogue: 6,0:04:27.58,0:04:30.00,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,テスト期間も部活あるし
Dialogue: 6,0:04:30.37,0:04:33.88,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,帰ってから勉強とかやる気起きないって
Dialogue: 6,0:04:34.21,0:04:36.01,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,筋トレはできるのに
Dialogue: 6,0:04:37.13,0:04:38.13,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,雛
Dialogue: 6,0:04:41.51,0:04:44.64,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,話しかけないでもらえます
Dialogue: 6,0:04:45.85,0:04:49.39,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,今英単語以外に頭使う余裕ないんだから
Dialogue: 6,0:04:50.02,0:04:52.61,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,仲間がいてくれてうれしいよ
Dialogue: 6,0:04:53.65,0:04:56.28,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,仲間にしないでもらえます
Dialogue: 6,0:04:56.28,0:04:58.40,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,私赤点取ったことないもん
Dialogue: 6,0:04:58.40,0:04:59.57,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,俺だって赤点は…
Dialogue: 6,0:04:59.57,0:05:00.82,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,中２の前期
Dialogue: 6,0:05:00.82,0:05:01.95,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,あれは腹痛で…
Dialogue: 6,0:05:01.95,0:05:04.58,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ああはいはい分かりました
Dialogue: 6,0:05:09.12,0:05:09.91,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ファイトー
Dialogue: 6,0:05:09.91,0:05:11.46,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ファイトー
Dialogue: 6,0:05:11.46,0:05:12.04,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,こっち
Dialogue: 6,0:05:12.04,0:05:12.75,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,はい
Dialogue: 6,0:05:12.75,0:05:15.42,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,女バスもう練習始めてる
Dialogue: 6,0:05:16.13,0:05:17.00,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,集中
Dialogue: 6,0:05:17.00,0:05:18.21,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,守れ守れ
Dialogue: 6,0:05:18.21,0:05:19.42,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,次いくよ
Dialogue: 6,0:05:20.76,0:05:23.26,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,インターハイまで２か月ないもんな
Dialogue: 6,0:05:23.64,0:05:25.93,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,夜も延長して練習してるし
Dialogue: 6,0:05:33.56,0:05:35.31,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,俺たちも負けてられんな
Dialogue: 6,0:05:35.61,0:05:39.11,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,さっ勉強は忘れて部活部活
Dialogue: 6,0:05:41.86,0:05:43.95,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,やっぱり落ち込んでるよね
Dialogue: 6,0:05:47.33,0:05:49.62,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,この前の県予選で負けて
Dialogue: 6,0:05:49.62,0:05:53.71,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,本人は想像もしてたみたいなこと言ってたけど
Dialogue: 6,0:05:54.88,0:05:57.67,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,千夏先輩はインターハイ決めたんだし
Dialogue: 6,0:05:58.09,0:05:59.80,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,家でも気まずそう
Dialogue: 6,0:06:00.80,0:06:04.26,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,先輩とはあんまり話せてないみたいだな
Dialogue: 6,0:06:05.01,0:06:06.93,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,テストと部活のすれ違いで
Dialogue: 6,0:06:08.93,0:06:10.22,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,そっか
Dialogue: 6,0:06:11.68,0:06:14.65,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ここで喜べるようなヤツではないんだよな
Dialogue: 6,0:06:17.11,0:06:19.48,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,まっ大喜なら大丈夫だって
Dialogue: 6,0:06:19.73,0:06:23.36,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,何があってもすぐ回復するのがあいつの長所なんだし
Dialogue: 6,0:06:26.57,0:06:27.83,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,そうだよね
Dialogue: 6,0:06:29.99,0:06:31.87,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,それじゃ改めて
Dialogue: 6,0:06:32.71,0:06:36.71,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,針生健吾君インターハイ出場おめでとう
Dialogue: 6,0:06:39.13,0:06:40.96,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,よかったよかった
Dialogue: 6,0:06:40.96,0:06:43.67,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,全枠佐知川に取られるのもしゃくだったし
Dialogue: 6,0:06:44.63,0:06:45.89,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,そこ？
Dialogue: 6,0:06:46.72,0:06:49.39,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ホントみんなのおかげだし
Dialogue: 6,0:06:50.14,0:06:51.85,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,これからインターハイまで
Dialogue: 6,0:06:51.85,0:06:53.89,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,迷惑かけるかもしれないけど
Dialogue: 6,0:06:54.56,0:06:57.40,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ご協力よろしくお願いします
Dialogue: 6,0:07:03.40,0:07:05.49,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,どんとこいよ
Dialogue: 6,0:07:05.49,0:07:06.78,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,西田はいいや
Dialogue: 6,0:07:07.82,0:07:09.41,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,こいよって
Dialogue: 6,0:07:10.70,0:07:12.83,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ダブルスはしばらくお休みか
Dialogue: 6,0:07:13.37,0:07:14.41,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,だろうな
Dialogue: 6,0:07:15.00,0:07:16.42,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ということで
Dialogue: 6,0:07:17.33,0:07:18.96,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,一段落したので
Dialogue: 6,0:07:18.96,0:07:21.92,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,それぞれ目標を書いてここに貼るように
Dialogue: 6,0:07:23.92,0:07:27.05,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,目標か何にするかな
Dialogue: 6,0:07:27.39,0:07:29.93,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,なんかデカいこと書きたいよな
Dialogue: 6,0:07:33.35,0:07:34.43,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,なんて読むの
Dialogue: 6,0:07:35.85,0:07:37.19,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,「ごうきかだん」
Dialogue: 6,0:07:37.19,0:07:39.52,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,これでよーし
Dialogue: 6,0:07:40.73,0:07:42.40,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,おい西田
Dialogue: 6,0:07:43.40,0:07:45.90,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,漢字間違ったなら書き直せよ
Dialogue: 6,0:07:46.78,0:07:49.28,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,気持ちがこもってればいいんだよ
Dialogue: 6,0:07:51.95,0:07:53.08,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,針生は
Dialogue: 6,0:07:57.04,0:07:59.71,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,俺の上に貼るのやめてもらえます
Dialogue: 6,0:08:00.84,0:08:03.25,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,針生の天井に貼ろうぜ
Dialogue: 6,0:08:03.55,0:08:05.80,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,天上天下唯我独尊ってこと
Dialogue: 6,0:08:08.84,0:08:09.80,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,よし
Dialogue: 6,0:08:16.81,0:08:18.64,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,大喜テープくれ
Dialogue: 6,0:08:19.73,0:08:20.56,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,おう
Dialogue: 6,0:08:22.69,0:08:26.15,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,あとお前ら赤点取らないってのも書いとけ
Dialogue: 6,0:08:26.15,0:08:30.20,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,監督できないことは書けないっすよ
Dialogue: 6,0:08:30.74,0:08:32.74,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,西田お前
Dialogue: 6,0:08:34.83,0:08:35.54,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ほい
Dialogue: 6,0:08:35.87,0:08:36.95,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,サンキュー
Dialogue: 6,0:08:42.42,0:08:43.75,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,Emmanuel is
Dialogue: 6,0:08:43.75,0:08:48.17,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,having some conversation with his best friend Kevin.
Dialogue: 6,0:08:48.59,0:08:52.05,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,Hey Kevin, you know that I recently...
Dialogue: 6,0:08:53.89,0:08:55.43,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ファイトー
Dialogue: 6,0:08:55.43,0:08:56.81,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ファイトー
Dialogue: 6,0:08:57.39,0:08:58.68,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,Fight
Dialogue: 6,0:08:58.68,0:09:00.27,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,誰だネイティブなヤツ
Dialogue: 6,0:09:06.53,0:09:08.28,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ファイトー
Dialogue: 6,0:09:22.88,0:09:24.13,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,夏風邪？
Dialogue: 6,0:09:25.67,0:09:27.42,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,休憩するか
Dialogue: 6,0:09:34.09,0:09:36.31,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,千夏ちゃんおかえり
Dialogue: 6,0:09:37.06,0:09:39.06,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,遅くまでお疲れさま
Dialogue: 6,0:09:39.06,0:09:41.27,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,すみません遅くなって
Dialogue: 6,0:09:41.27,0:09:43.90,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ううんいいのよいいのよ
Dialogue: 6,0:09:43.90,0:09:45.56,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,うちのことは気にしないで
Dialogue: 6,0:09:45.90,0:09:47.82,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,インターハイのためだもの
Dialogue: 6,0:09:48.90,0:09:50.32,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ありがとうございます
Dialogue: 6,0:10:15.68,0:10:19.35,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,終わった
Dialogue: 6,0:10:19.97,0:10:21.48,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,俺たち頑張った
Dialogue: 6,0:10:21.48,0:10:22.98,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,頑張ったよ
Dialogue: 6,0:10:23.73,0:10:26.86,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,テストのあとに部活までしっかりやって
Dialogue: 6,0:10:27.40,0:10:30.78,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,結果はどうあれやり遂げたことに意味がある
Dialogue: 6,0:10:30.78,0:10:32.36,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,そうだそうだ
Dialogue: 6,0:10:33.11,0:10:35.24,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,打ち上げにファミレス行こうぜ
Dialogue: 6,0:10:35.24,0:10:36.41,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,いいね
Dialogue: 6,0:10:36.41,0:10:38.20,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,西田のおごりだ
Dialogue: 6,0:10:39.29,0:10:40.37,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,行く行く
Dialogue: 6,0:10:41.04,0:10:43.04,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,いやなんでそうなった
Dialogue: 6,0:10:43.66,0:10:44.96,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,大喜どうする
Dialogue: 6,0:10:47.08,0:10:49.13,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,俺はパスするわ
Dialogue: 6,0:10:49.55,0:10:50.75,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,大丈夫かよ
Dialogue: 6,0:10:51.34,0:10:53.26,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ちょっと寝不足なだけ
Dialogue: 6,0:10:53.26,0:10:54.93,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,帰って寝たら平気
Dialogue: 6,0:10:57.18,0:11:00.64,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,明日からまた練習頑張らないといけないしな
Dialogue: 6,0:11:01.56,0:11:02.93,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,お疲れさまっした
Dialogue: 6,0:11:02.93,0:11:04.48,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,お疲れ
Dialogue: 6,0:11:05.60,0:11:07.27,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,じゃあ俺たちも行くか
Dialogue: 6,0:11:07.27,0:11:07.90,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,そうだな
Dialogue: 6,0:11:26.54,0:11:28.17,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,頭痛え
Dialogue: 6,0:11:29.42,0:11:31.50,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,これ熱あるやつだ
Dialogue: 6,0:11:33.05,0:11:34.55,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ポカリ飲みたい
Dialogue: 6,0:11:35.55,0:11:37.55,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,でも家誰もいないし
Dialogue: 6,0:11:38.51,0:11:42.64,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,千夏先輩には絶対うつさないようにしないと
Dialogue: 6,0:11:45.98,0:11:47.14,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ヤバい
Dialogue: 6,0:11:51.77,0:11:53.48,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,こういうときって
Dialogue: 6,0:11:58.36,0:12:00.28,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,嫌なこと思い出す
Dialogue: 6,0:12:02.33,0:12:05.75,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,せっかくテストで頭から消してたのに
Dialogue: 6,0:12:07.62,0:12:12.04,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,元気なら走りにいって頭空っぽにするのに
Dialogue: 6,0:12:21.60,0:12:23.72,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,インターハイ行ってください
Dialogue: 6,0:12:25.22,0:12:28.14,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ありがとう猪股太喜くん
Dialogue: 6,0:12:30.60,0:12:32.15,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,大切にしちゃダメだよ
Dialogue: 6,0:12:33.11,0:12:34.27,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,次は勝ちます
Dialogue: 6,0:12:35.07,0:12:36.19,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,その調子
Dialogue: 6,0:12:36.44,0:12:39.82,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,けど大喜は強くなると思うよ
Dialogue: 6,0:12:41.12,0:12:42.12,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,はい
Dialogue: 6,0:12:42.45,0:12:46.16,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,余計なこと考えないでただそれを発揮してくること
Dialogue: 6,0:12:47.96,0:12:48.87,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,どうか
Dialogue: 6,0:12:50.42,0:12:55.09,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,どうか俺と千夏先輩がインターハイに行けますように
Dialogue: 6,0:12:56.17,0:12:58.05,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,大喜一本
Dialogue: 6,0:13:16.44,0:13:18.28,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,俺ってかっこ悪い
Dialogue: 6,0:13:20.28,0:13:21.70,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,そんなことないよ
Dialogue: 6,0:13:33.42,0:13:34.59,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,熱い
Dialogue: 6,0:13:41.26,0:13:42.59,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,お疲れさま
Dialogue: 6,0:13:52.19,0:13:53.56,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,千夏先輩
Dialogue: 6,0:13:54.40,0:13:55.23,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ダメです
Dialogue: 6,0:13:55.23,0:13:56.82,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,俺今体調悪くて
Dialogue: 6,0:13:56.82,0:13:58.65,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,うつったら大変なので出て…
Dialogue: 6,0:13:58.65,0:13:59.86,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,いいから
Dialogue: 6,0:14:00.69,0:14:02.86,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,病人は静かにしてなさい
Dialogue: 6,0:14:05.37,0:14:06.45,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,はい
Dialogue: 6,0:14:44.66,0:14:45.45,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,はい
Dialogue: 6,0:14:48.66,0:14:50.29,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,うどんがあったから
Dialogue: 6,0:14:50.29,0:14:52.83,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,とりあえず何か胃に入れよう
Dialogue: 6,0:14:53.66,0:14:54.75,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,うどん…
Dialogue: 6,0:14:55.17,0:14:57.21,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,千夏先輩の手料理
Dialogue: 6,0:14:58.29,0:14:59.09,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,はい
Dialogue: 6,0:15:01.80,0:15:04.80,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,由紀子さん帰るの遅いみたいだから
Dialogue: 6,0:15:05.59,0:15:08.14,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,簡単なもので申し訳ないけど
Dialogue: 6,0:15:10.06,0:15:11.64,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ありがとうございます
Dialogue: 6,0:15:13.85,0:15:15.94,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,先輩の手料理
Dialogue: 6,0:15:19.90,0:15:21.19,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,いただきます
Dialogue: 6,0:15:30.28,0:15:33.87,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,鼻が詰まって味がよく分からない
Dialogue: 6,0:15:34.66,0:15:37.12,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ほかに欲しいものあったら言ってね
Dialogue: 6,0:15:38.29,0:15:39.75,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ありがとうございます
Dialogue: 6,0:15:45.67,0:15:46.59,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,いや
Dialogue: 6,0:15:50.51,0:15:53.14,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,久しぶりにこんな近くにいるな
Dialogue: 6,0:15:53.43,0:15:55.64,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,２錠でいいのかな
Dialogue: 6,0:15:56.81,0:15:57.64,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,あの
Dialogue: 6,0:15:59.52,0:16:01.48,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ホントもう大丈夫なので
Dialogue: 6,0:16:01.48,0:16:03.65,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,部屋戻ってもらっていいですよ
Dialogue: 6,0:16:04.44,0:16:06.53,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,大喜君が寝るまでいるよ
Dialogue: 6,0:16:06.53,0:16:09.16,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,体調悪化するかもしれないし
Dialogue: 6,0:16:09.99,0:16:12.16,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,でも眠くないですし
Dialogue: 6,0:16:14.75,0:16:17.41,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,じゃあ少しお話してもいい
Dialogue: 6,0:16:17.96,0:16:22.25,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ほら大会とかテストで最近話せてなかったし
Dialogue: 6,0:16:22.75,0:16:25.17,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,それに大喜君言ってたでしょ
Dialogue: 6,0:16:25.71,0:16:29.43,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,大会が終わったら私に質問があるって
Dialogue: 6,0:16:31.51,0:16:33.56,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,あの千夏先輩
Dialogue: 6,0:16:33.56,0:16:36.68,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,明日が終わったら１つ質問していいですか
Dialogue: 6,0:16:37.18,0:16:40.06,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,そんなこと言いましたっけ
Dialogue: 6,0:16:40.52,0:16:42.44,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,しらばっくれる気だ
Dialogue: 6,0:16:43.36,0:16:45.15,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,そんなことないですよ
Dialogue: 6,0:16:47.11,0:16:48.70,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ただあのときは
Dialogue: 6,0:16:50.11,0:16:53.66,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,それを聞けるだけの自信があったから
Dialogue: 6,0:16:54.87,0:16:58.16,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,蝶野さんを見てうらやましいなって
Dialogue: 6,0:17:09.26,0:17:11.97,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,じゃあ私から質問していい
Dialogue: 6,0:17:13.18,0:17:13.93,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,はい
Dialogue: 6,0:17:14.39,0:17:18.98,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,今日バド部の目標が書かれた貼り紙を見たんだけど
Dialogue: 6,0:17:20.73,0:17:25.07,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,大喜君なら「インターハイ出場」って書くと思った
Dialogue: 6,0:17:27.32,0:17:31.24,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,だからなんで書かなかったのかなって
Dialogue: 6,0:17:32.61,0:17:33.74,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,あれは…
Dialogue: 6,0:17:35.08,0:17:40.25,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,試合でスマッシュが決まっていればって思うところがいくつもあったし
Dialogue: 6,0:17:41.16,0:17:45.46,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,インターハイは俺には遠すぎたのかもしれないと思って
Dialogue: 6,0:17:46.88,0:17:48.84,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,いざ大会に出てみると
Dialogue: 6,0:17:49.51,0:17:51.38,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,俺より強い人ばっかりで
Dialogue: 6,0:17:54.18,0:17:58.10,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,千夏先輩は１年でインターハイの厳しさを知って
Dialogue: 6,0:17:58.39,0:18:01.39,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,それでも挑戦する覚悟があったけど
Dialogue: 6,0:18:02.73,0:18:07.19,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,俺はただ行きたい勝ちたいってだけで
Dialogue: 6,0:18:07.69,0:18:10.15,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,身の程知らずだったかもって
Dialogue: 6,0:18:16.87,0:18:18.99,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,あの笑ってます
Dialogue: 6,0:18:19.33,0:18:20.41,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ごめん
Dialogue: 6,0:18:21.54,0:18:25.04,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,大喜君でもそういうこと考えるんだね
Dialogue: 6,0:18:26.50,0:18:28.13,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ごちそうさまでした
Dialogue: 6,0:18:28.42,0:18:29.76,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,おそまつさま
Dialogue: 6,0:18:30.46,0:18:33.93,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,いや考えるとは思ったけど
Dialogue: 6,0:18:34.26,0:18:36.55,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,表に出さないイメージだったから
Dialogue: 6,0:18:37.22,0:18:38.64,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,そんなことは
Dialogue: 6,0:18:39.93,0:18:42.81,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,いいじゃんニュー大喜君
Dialogue: 6,0:18:44.39,0:18:48.52,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,遠くの目標を持ちつつ近くの自分も見れば
Dialogue: 6,0:18:49.98,0:18:54.07,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,けど今の俺に遠くの目標は…
Dialogue: 6,0:18:54.99,0:18:57.57,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,大喜君は覚悟って言ったけど
Dialogue: 6,0:18:59.37,0:19:01.58,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,身の程知らずなんじゃないかとか
Dialogue: 6,0:19:02.66,0:19:04.58,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,無理かもしれないとか
Dialogue: 6,0:19:05.21,0:19:08.84,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,私もずっと頭の片隅で思ってたよ
Dialogue: 6,0:19:09.71,0:19:12.09,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,覚悟がプレッシャーになって
Dialogue: 6,0:19:17.76,0:19:20.39,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,妥協したらどんなに楽だろうって
Dialogue: 6,0:19:22.56,0:19:25.52,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,そんなこと考える自分も嫌になって
Dialogue: 6,0:19:27.56,0:19:32.19,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,だけどインターハイ行きたいっていうのがあったから
Dialogue: 6,0:19:32.61,0:19:34.36,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,朝一番に起きれた
Dialogue: 6,0:19:35.40,0:19:38.99,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,私は「こうなりたい」「こうしたい」があるなら
Dialogue: 6,0:19:39.37,0:19:41.41,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,それを大切にしてほしい
Dialogue: 6,0:19:42.41,0:19:46.37,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,遠くの目標を持つことを怖がらないでほしい
Dialogue: 6,0:19:47.08,0:19:52.05,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,どんなに身の程知らずでもそれが努力する原動力になるなら
Dialogue: 6,0:19:52.05,0:19:54.38,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,それで十分だと思うし
Dialogue: 6,0:19:55.13,0:19:58.51,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,そういう人を私は応援するよ
Dialogue: 6,0:20:05.18,0:20:06.35,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,大丈夫
Dialogue: 6,0:20:06.64,0:20:07.39,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,はい
Dialogue: 6,0:20:07.69,0:20:08.40,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ごめん
Dialogue: 6,0:20:08.94,0:20:10.27,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,もう寝て
Dialogue: 6,0:20:13.11,0:20:14.15,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,俺…
Dialogue: 6,0:20:15.74,0:20:18.53,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,この人のこういうところが好きだ
Dialogue: 6,0:20:19.41,0:20:22.41,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,自分で感じて悩んで
Dialogue: 6,0:20:22.41,0:20:25.08,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,行動してきた経験があるから
Dialogue: 6,0:20:26.33,0:20:28.67,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,相手の気持ちも考えられる
Dialogue: 6,0:20:30.50,0:20:32.17,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,優しくできる人
Dialogue: 6,0:20:34.71,0:20:38.13,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,貼り紙書き足しておきます
Dialogue: 6,0:20:44.26,0:20:45.27,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 6,0:20:52.11,0:20:54.98,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,それじゃ片付けてくるね
Dialogue: 6,0:20:55.61,0:20:56.69,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,俺やりますよ
Dialogue: 6,0:20:56.69,0:20:58.45,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,いいから寝てて
Dialogue: 6,0:20:59.07,0:20:59.95,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,でも…
Dialogue: 6,0:21:26.72,0:21:28.35,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,すみません
Dialogue: 6,0:21:32.23,0:21:34.48,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ふらついてしまって
Dialogue: 7,0:00:06.28,0:00:09.61,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,对呀 你的努力阿姨都看在眼里呢
Dialogue: 7,0:00:09.61,0:00:10.91,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 7,0:00:10.91,0:00:13.45,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,哎哟 阿姨太为你高兴了
Dialogue: 7,0:00:14.37,0:00:16.20,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,一定给你做好后勤工作
Dialogue: 7,0:00:16.50,0:00:18.83,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,全国大赛前得把身体照顾好
Dialogue: 7,0:00:18.83,0:00:20.04,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,今天吃大餐
Dialogue: 7,0:00:20.04,0:00:21.79,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,谢谢阿姨
Dialogue: 7,0:00:23.00,0:00:24.21,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 7,0:00:26.05,0:00:28.68,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,千夏学姐打进全国大赛了
Dialogue: 7,0:00:29.18,0:00:30.39,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 7,0:00:30.97,0:00:32.43,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 7,0:00:33.14,0:00:36.22,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,厉害 太厉害了
Dialogue: 7,0:00:36.22,0:00:38.64,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,她说到做到了
Dialogue: 7,0:00:38.98,0:00:40.48,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,太帅了
Dialogue: 7,0:00:46.11,0:00:47.11,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 7,0:00:49.49,0:00:50.20,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,界内
Dialogue: 7,0:00:50.91,0:00:54.66,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,比赛结束 21比11 21比13
Dialogue: 7,0:00:55.66,0:00:58.33,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,佐知川高中 游佐胜
Dialogue: 7,0:01:03.38,0:01:04.38,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 7,0:01:07.34,0:01:08.34,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 7,0:01:12.34,0:01:13.34,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 7,0:01:23.15,0:01:24.48,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,却输了
Dialogue: 7,0:03:07.58,0:03:09.04,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,快跟上
Dialogue: 7,0:03:09.04,0:03:10.04,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,等等我
Dialogue: 7,0:03:10.04,0:03:11.38,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,你太慢了
Dialogue: 7,0:03:34.65,0:03:36.07,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,已经不行了
Dialogue: 7,0:03:37.70,0:03:39.16,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,到极限了
Dialogue: 7,0:03:40.28,0:03:42.12,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,我只能放弃了
Dialogue: 7,0:03:44.41,0:03:46.66,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,期末考试
Dialogue: 7,0:03:48.29,0:03:51.59,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,为什么大赛一结束就要考试啊
Dialogue: 7,0:03:52.25,0:03:54.55,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,都劝你每天学一点了
Dialogue: 7,0:03:55.09,0:03:56.47,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,去训练吧
Dialogue: 7,0:03:56.80,0:04:00.68,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,每天学一点才是最难的 好吗
Dialogue: 7,0:04:00.68,0:04:02.85,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,站着说话不腰疼
Dialogue: 7,0:04:03.43,0:04:05.60,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,谅你也不懂
Dialogue: 7,0:04:05.60,0:04:07.48,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,还闹起别扭来了
Dialogue: 7,0:04:14.15,0:04:15.15,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,久等了
Dialogue: 7,0:04:15.15,0:04:16.57,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,没有 辛苦了
Dialogue: 7,0:04:17.45,0:04:19.49,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,比赛打算参加哪个项目
Dialogue: 7,0:04:19.49,0:04:21.66,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,可能朗诵吧
Dialogue: 7,0:04:27.58,0:04:30.00,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,考试周还要训练
Dialogue: 7,0:04:30.37,0:04:33.88,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,回家以后根本提不起劲学习啊
Dialogue: 7,0:04:34.21,0:04:36.01,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,但有劲健身是吧
Dialogue: 7,0:04:37.13,0:04:38.13,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,小雏
Dialogue: 7,0:04:41.51,0:04:44.64,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,能别跟我搭话吗
Dialogue: 7,0:04:45.85,0:04:49.39,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,现在脑子里装不下英语单词以外的东西
Dialogue: 7,0:04:50.02,0:04:52.61,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,看到有人跟我作伴可真开心
Dialogue: 7,0:04:53.65,0:04:56.28,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,别把我跟你混为一谈
Dialogue: 7,0:04:56.28,0:04:58.40,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,我可没有不及格过
Dialogue: 7,0:04:58.40,0:04:59.57,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,我也没有…
Dialogue: 7,0:04:59.57,0:05:00.82,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,初二上学期
Dialogue: 7,0:05:00.82,0:05:01.95,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,那是因为肚子疼…
Dialogue: 7,0:05:01.95,0:05:04.58,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,嗯 是是是 懂的懂的
Dialogue: 7,0:05:09.12,0:05:09.91,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 7,0:05:09.91,0:05:11.46,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 7,0:05:11.46,0:05:12.04,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 7,0:05:12.04,0:05:12.75,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 7,0:05:12.75,0:05:15.42,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,女篮已经开始训练了啊
Dialogue: 7,0:05:16.13,0:05:17.00,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,专注
Dialogue: 7,0:05:17.00,0:05:18.21,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,防好 防好
Dialogue: 7,0:05:18.21,0:05:19.42,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,继续
Dialogue: 7,0:05:20.76,0:05:23.26,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,全国大赛还有不到两个月了
Dialogue: 7,0:05:23.64,0:05:25.93,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,晚上也在加训
Dialogue: 7,0:05:33.56,0:05:35.31,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,我们也不能输啊
Dialogue: 7,0:05:35.61,0:05:39.11,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,好了 忘掉学习来训练吧 训练
Dialogue: 7,0:05:41.86,0:05:43.95,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,他果然还在消沉吧
Dialogue: 7,0:05:47.33,0:05:49.62,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,之前输了县预选赛
Dialogue: 7,0:05:49.62,0:05:53.71,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,虽然他说他自己早有心理准备
Dialogue: 7,0:05:54.88,0:05:57.67,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,但千夏学姐打进了全国大赛
Dialogue: 7,0:05:58.09,0:05:59.80,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,在家里应该也有点尴尬
Dialogue: 7,0:06:00.80,0:06:04.26,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,他最近好像没怎么和千夏学姐说上话
Dialogue: 7,0:06:05.01,0:06:06.93,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,他要复习 以及社团活动错开了
Dialogue: 7,0:06:08.93,0:06:10.22,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 7,0:06:11.68,0:06:14.65,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,你确实也不是那种会因此高兴的人啊
Dialogue: 7,0:06:17.11,0:06:19.48,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,大喜这人应该没事的
Dialogue: 7,0:06:19.73,0:06:23.36,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,他的优点就是不管发生什么都能很快重振旗鼓
Dialogue: 7,0:06:26.57,0:06:27.83,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 7,0:06:29.99,0:06:31.87,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,正式祝贺
Dialogue: 7,0:06:32.71,0:06:36.71,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,针生健吾同学拿到全国大赛参赛资格
Dialogue: 7,0:06:39.13,0:06:40.96,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,谢天谢地了啊
Dialogue: 7,0:06:40.96,0:06:43.67,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,还好没被佐知川把名额全占了
Dialogue: 7,0:06:44.63,0:06:45.89,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,关注点是这个？
Dialogue: 7,0:06:46.72,0:06:49.39,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,没有你们我做不到
Dialogue: 7,0:06:50.14,0:06:51.85,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,大赛开始前的这段时间
Dialogue: 7,0:06:51.85,0:06:53.89,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,可能还会给各位添不少麻烦
Dialogue: 7,0:06:54.56,0:06:57.40,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,还望各位多多协助
Dialogue: 7,0:07:03.40,0:07:05.49,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,尽管来麻烦我吧
Dialogue: 7,0:07:05.49,0:07:06.78,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,西田就算了吧
Dialogue: 7,0:07:07.82,0:07:09.41,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,来嘛来嘛
Dialogue: 7,0:07:10.70,0:07:12.83,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,双打暂时不练了吗
Dialogue: 7,0:07:13.37,0:07:14.41,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,应该吧
Dialogue: 7,0:07:15.00,0:07:16.42,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,接下来呢
Dialogue: 7,0:07:17.33,0:07:18.96,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,本阶段也结束了
Dialogue: 7,0:07:18.96,0:07:21.92,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,你们就写下各自的下一阶段目标 贴在这里
Dialogue: 7,0:07:23.92,0:07:27.05,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,目标啊 写什么好呢
Dialogue: 7,0:07:27.39,0:07:29.93,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,想写个大一点的
Dialogue: 7,0:07:33.35,0:07:34.43,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,这个怎么读
Dialogue: 7,0:07:35.85,0:07:37.19,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,「刚毅果断」
Dialogue: 7,0:07:37.19,0:07:39.52,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,贴好了
Dialogue: 7,0:07:40.73,0:07:42.40,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,喂 西田
Dialogue: 7,0:07:43.40,0:07:45.90,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,汉字写错了你就重写一张啊
Dialogue: 7,0:07:46.78,0:07:49.28,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,能表现出我的决心就够了
Dialogue: 7,0:07:51.95,0:07:53.08,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,针生
Dialogue: 7,0:07:57.04,0:07:59.71,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,可不可以不要贴在我的上面
Dialogue: 7,0:08:00.84,0:08:03.25,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,把针生的贴到天花板上吧
Dialogue: 7,0:08:03.55,0:08:05.80,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,意思是天上天下唯我独尊吗
Dialogue: 7,0:08:08.84,0:08:09.80,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 7,0:08:16.81,0:08:18.64,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,大喜 给我胶带
Dialogue: 7,0:08:19.73,0:08:20.56,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 7,0:08:22.69,0:08:26.15,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,哦 还有 你们把「不挂科」也写上吧
Dialogue: 7,0:08:26.15,0:08:30.20,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,教练 做不到的事我下不了笔啊
Dialogue: 7,0:08:30.74,0:08:32.74,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,西田 你小子
Dialogue: 7,0:08:34.83,0:08:35.54,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,给
Dialogue: 7,0:08:35.87,0:08:36.95,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,谢了
Dialogue: 7,0:08:42.42,0:08:43.75,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,以马内利
Dialogue: 7,0:08:43.75,0:08:48.17,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,正在和他最好的朋友凯文聊天
Dialogue: 7,0:08:48.59,0:08:52.05,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,嘿 凯文 你知道我最近…
Dialogue: 7,0:08:53.89,0:08:55.43,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 7,0:08:55.43,0:08:56.81,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 7,0:08:57.39,0:08:58.68,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,Fight
Dialogue: 7,0:08:58.68,0:09:00.27,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,谁在那里说标准英语的
Dialogue: 7,0:09:06.53,0:09:08.28,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 7,0:09:22.88,0:09:24.13,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,热伤风？
Dialogue: 7,0:09:25.67,0:09:27.42,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,休息一下吧
Dialogue: 7,0:09:34.09,0:09:36.31,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,千夏 欢迎回来
Dialogue: 7,0:09:37.06,0:09:39.06,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,辛苦了 训练到这么晚
Dialogue: 7,0:09:39.06,0:09:41.27,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我回来晚了
Dialogue: 7,0:09:41.27,0:09:43.90,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,哎呀 没事没事
Dialogue: 7,0:09:43.90,0:09:45.56,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,别怕麻烦了我们
Dialogue: 7,0:09:45.90,0:09:47.82,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,都是为了全国大赛嘛
Dialogue: 7,0:09:48.90,0:09:50.32,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,谢谢您
Dialogue: 7,0:10:15.68,0:10:19.35,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,结束了
Dialogue: 7,0:10:19.97,0:10:21.48,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,我们努力了
Dialogue: 7,0:10:21.48,0:10:22.98,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,真的努力了
Dialogue: 7,0:10:23.73,0:10:26.86,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,考完试还勤勤恳恳地参加训练
Dialogue: 7,0:10:27.40,0:10:30.78,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,不管结果如何 只要完成了就有意义
Dialogue: 7,0:10:30.78,0:10:32.36,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,对啊 对啊
Dialogue: 7,0:10:33.11,0:10:35.24,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,去家庭餐厅搓一顿吧 当是庆祝了
Dialogue: 7,0:10:35.24,0:10:36.41,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 7,0:10:36.41,0:10:38.20,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,西田说他请客
Dialogue: 7,0:10:39.29,0:10:40.37,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,我要去
Dialogue: 7,0:10:41.04,0:10:43.04,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,不是 怎么变成我请客了
Dialogue: 7,0:10:43.66,0:10:44.96,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,大喜 你去吗
Dialogue: 7,0:10:47.08,0:10:49.13,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,我就不去了
Dialogue: 7,0:10:49.55,0:10:50.75,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 7,0:10:51.34,0:10:53.26,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,只是有点没睡好
Dialogue: 7,0:10:53.26,0:10:54.93,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,回家睡一觉就好了
Dialogue: 7,0:10:57.18,0:11:00.64,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,明天开始还得继续努力练习呢
Dialogue: 7,0:11:01.56,0:11:02.93,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 7,0:11:02.93,0:11:04.48,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,辛苦
Dialogue: 7,0:11:05.60,0:11:07.27,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,那我们也走吧
Dialogue: 7,0:11:07.27,0:11:07.90,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 7,0:11:26.54,0:11:28.17,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,头好痛
Dialogue: 7,0:11:29.42,0:11:31.50,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,这是发烧了吧
Dialogue: 7,0:11:33.05,0:11:34.55,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,好想喝宝矿力
Dialogue: 7,0:11:35.55,0:11:37.55,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,但是家里又没人
Dialogue: 7,0:11:38.51,0:11:42.64,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,一定不能传染给千夏学姐
Dialogue: 7,0:11:45.98,0:11:47.14,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 7,0:11:51.77,0:11:53.48,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,这种时候总会
Dialogue: 7,0:11:58.36,0:12:00.28,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,想起不愉快的事
Dialogue: 7,0:12:02.33,0:12:05.75,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,好不容易才借着考试忘了失利
Dialogue: 7,0:12:07.62,0:12:12.04,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,要是没感冒 能跑两圈放空大脑就好了
Dialogue: 7,0:12:21.60,0:12:23.72,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,请你一定要晋级全国大赛
Dialogue: 7,0:12:25.22,0:12:28.14,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 猪股大喜
Dialogue: 7,0:12:30.60,0:12:32.15,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,不能收着不用哦
Dialogue: 7,0:12:33.11,0:12:34.27,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,下次我会赢的
Dialogue: 7,0:12:35.07,0:12:36.19,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,就是这股劲
Dialogue: 7,0:12:36.44,0:12:39.82,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,不过 我觉得大喜能变强
Dialogue: 7,0:12:41.12,0:12:42.12,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 7,0:12:42.45,0:12:46.16,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,别多想 把练过的东西发挥出来就行了
Dialogue: 7,0:12:47.96,0:12:48.87,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,请保佑
Dialogue: 7,0:12:50.42,0:12:55.09,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,保佑我和千夏学姐都能打进全国大赛
Dialogue: 7,0:12:56.17,0:12:58.05,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,大喜 一本
Dialogue: 7,0:13:16.44,0:13:18.28,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,我真没出息
Dialogue: 7,0:13:20.28,0:13:21.70,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,没这回事
Dialogue: 7,0:13:33.42,0:13:34.59,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,好烫
Dialogue: 7,0:13:41.26,0:13:42.59,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,训练辛苦了
Dialogue: 7,0:13:52.19,0:13:53.56,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,千夏学姐
Dialogue: 7,0:13:54.40,0:13:55.23,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,别靠近我
Dialogue: 7,0:13:55.23,0:13:56.82,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,我身体不太舒服
Dialogue: 7,0:13:56.82,0:13:58.65,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,千万不能传给你 你先出…
Dialogue: 7,0:13:58.65,0:13:59.86,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,听话
Dialogue: 7,0:14:00.69,0:14:02.86,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,病人就安安静静地休息
Dialogue: 7,0:14:05.37,0:14:06.45,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 7,0:14:44.66,0:14:45.45,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,请进
Dialogue: 7,0:14:48.66,0:14:50.29,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,冰箱里有乌冬面
Dialogue: 7,0:14:50.29,0:14:52.83,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,总之先垫垫肚子吧
Dialogue: 7,0:14:53.66,0:14:54.75,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,乌冬面…
Dialogue: 7,0:14:55.17,0:14:57.21,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,千夏学姐做的
Dialogue: 7,0:14:58.29,0:14:59.09,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 7,0:15:01.80,0:15:04.80,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,由纪子阿姨好像得晚些才回来
Dialogue: 7,0:15:05.59,0:15:08.14,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,有点简单 凑合吃吧
Dialogue: 7,0:15:10.06,0:15:11.64,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 7,0:15:13.85,0:15:15.94,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,学姐亲手做的
Dialogue: 7,0:15:19.90,0:15:21.19,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,我开动了
Dialogue: 7,0:15:30.28,0:15:33.87,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,鼻子堵了 尝不出什么味道
Dialogue: 7,0:15:34.66,0:15:37.12,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,想要什么就跟我说哦
Dialogue: 7,0:15:38.29,0:15:39.75,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 7,0:15:45.67,0:15:46.59,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 7,0:15:50.51,0:15:53.14,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,好久没如此近距离接触学姐了
Dialogue: 7,0:15:53.43,0:15:55.64,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,是吃两片吗
Dialogue: 7,0:15:56.81,0:15:57.64,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 7,0:15:59.52,0:16:01.48,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,我真的已经没事了
Dialogue: 7,0:16:01.48,0:16:03.65,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,不用一直这样守着我
Dialogue: 7,0:16:04.44,0:16:06.53,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,等你睡着了我再走
Dialogue: 7,0:16:06.53,0:16:09.16,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,症状还可能恶化呢
Dialogue: 7,0:16:09.99,0:16:12.16,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,但我还不困
Dialogue: 7,0:16:14.75,0:16:17.41,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,那我们聊聊天吧 好吗
Dialogue: 7,0:16:17.96,0:16:22.25,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,最近又是比赛又是考试 都没怎么说话
Dialogue: 7,0:16:22.75,0:16:25.17,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,我记得你之前说过
Dialogue: 7,0:16:25.71,0:16:29.43,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,等比赛结束后有问题要问我
Dialogue: 7,0:16:31.51,0:16:33.56,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,那个 千夏学姐
Dialogue: 7,0:16:33.56,0:16:36.68,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,明天比赛结束后 我能问你个问题吗
Dialogue: 7,0:16:37.18,0:16:40.06,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,我说过这种话吗
Dialogue: 7,0:16:40.52,0:16:42.44,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,一看就是装傻充愣
Dialogue: 7,0:16:43.36,0:16:45.15,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,我哪有啊
Dialogue: 7,0:16:47.11,0:16:48.70,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,我当时只是
Dialogue: 7,0:16:50.11,0:16:53.66,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,有一种能把那个问题问出口的自信
Dialogue: 7,0:16:54.87,0:16:58.16,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,看蝶野吃了 感觉好羡慕啊
Dialogue: 7,0:17:09.26,0:17:11.97,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,那我能问你一个问题吗
Dialogue: 7,0:17:13.18,0:17:13.93,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,可以
Dialogue: 7,0:17:14.39,0:17:18.98,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,今天我看到你们羽毛球部在墙上贴了目标
Dialogue: 7,0:17:20.73,0:17:25.07,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,本以为你一定会写「晋级全国大赛」
Dialogue: 7,0:17:27.32,0:17:31.24,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,我很好奇为什么你没这样写
Dialogue: 7,0:17:32.61,0:17:33.74,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,因为…
Dialogue: 7,0:17:35.08,0:17:40.25,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,这次比赛有好多次杀球没得分 要是杀成了就好了
Dialogue: 7,0:17:41.16,0:17:45.46,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,也早想过自己的水平可能远远不够打进全国大赛
Dialogue: 7,0:17:46.88,0:17:48.84,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,但真正上场时我才知道
Dialogue: 7,0:17:49.51,0:17:51.38,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,强过我的人比比皆是
Dialogue: 7,0:17:54.18,0:17:58.10,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,你用高一时就知晓了全国大赛的残酷
Dialogue: 7,0:17:58.39,0:18:01.39,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,却依然决心发起挑战
Dialogue: 7,0:18:02.73,0:18:07.19,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,反观我 只是「想去打 想赢」
Dialogue: 7,0:18:07.69,0:18:10.15,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,或许是不知天高地厚了
Dialogue: 7,0:18:16.87,0:18:18.99,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,你笑什么呀
Dialogue: 7,0:18:19.33,0:18:20.41,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 7,0:18:21.54,0:18:25.04,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,我只是有点惊讶你也会想这些啊
Dialogue: 7,0:18:26.50,0:18:28.13,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,谢谢款待
Dialogue: 7,0:18:28.42,0:18:29.76,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,粗茶淡饭而已
Dialogue: 7,0:18:30.46,0:18:33.93,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,不对 我也想过你会思考这些
Dialogue: 7,0:18:34.26,0:18:36.55,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,但感觉你不会轻易外露
Dialogue: 7,0:18:37.22,0:18:38.64,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,也没有吧
Dialogue: 7,0:18:39.93,0:18:42.81,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,挺好的 发现新大喜了
Dialogue: 7,0:18:44.39,0:18:48.52,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,志存高远没错 脚踏实地更没错
Dialogue: 7,0:18:49.98,0:18:54.07,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,可对现在的我来说 远大的志向…
Dialogue: 7,0:18:54.99,0:18:57.57,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,虽然你说我有发起挑战的决心
Dialogue: 7,0:18:59.37,0:19:01.58,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,但「或许是不知天高地厚了」
Dialogue: 7,0:19:02.66,0:19:04.58,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,或者「我可能做不到」
Dialogue: 7,0:19:05.21,0:19:08.84,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,这类想法我也从未能摒弃
Dialogue: 7,0:19:09.71,0:19:12.09,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,自己的决心成了压力
Dialogue: 7,0:19:17.76,0:19:20.39,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,也会想要放弃 让自己卸下压力
Dialogue: 7,0:19:22.56,0:19:25.52,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,然后讨厌起有这些想法的自己
Dialogue: 7,0:19:27.56,0:19:32.19,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,但是也正因为有全国大赛这个目标
Dialogue: 7,0:19:32.61,0:19:34.36,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,我才能做到每天早起
Dialogue: 7,0:19:35.40,0:19:38.99,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,我觉得你既然有着想要达成的目标
Dialogue: 7,0:19:39.37,0:19:41.41,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,就希望你能珍惜它
Dialogue: 7,0:19:42.41,0:19:46.37,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,希望你不要害怕去拥有远大志向
Dialogue: 7,0:19:47.08,0:19:52.05,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,哪怕它再怎么远在天边 只要它能成为你的动力源泉
Dialogue: 7,0:19:52.05,0:19:54.38,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,那就足够了
Dialogue: 7,0:19:55.13,0:19:58.51,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,我支持这样的人
Dialogue: 7,0:20:05.18,0:20:06.35,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,你还好吗
Dialogue: 7,0:20:06.64,0:20:07.39,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 7,0:20:07.69,0:20:08.40,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 7,0:20:08.94,0:20:10.27,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,你快睡吧
Dialogue: 7,0:20:13.11,0:20:14.15,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 7,0:20:15.74,0:20:18.53,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,特别喜欢她这一点
Dialogue: 7,0:20:19.41,0:20:22.41,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,她感受过 烦恼过
Dialogue: 7,0:20:22.41,0:20:25.08,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,有着付诸过行动的经验
Dialogue: 7,0:20:26.33,0:20:28.67,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,才能更好地理解对方的感受
Dialogue: 7,0:20:30.50,0:20:32.17,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,才能真正做到体谅对方
Dialogue: 7,0:20:34.71,0:20:38.13,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,我会把纸上写的目标补全的
Dialogue: 7,0:20:44.26,0:20:45.27,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 7,0:20:52.11,0:20:54.98,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,那我去收拾收拾
Dialogue: 7,0:20:55.61,0:20:56.69,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,我来吧
Dialogue: 7,0:20:56.69,0:20:58.45,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,没事 你睡吧
Dialogue: 7,0:20:59.07,0:20:59.95,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 7,0:21:26.72,0:21:28.35,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 7,0:21:32.23,0:21:34.48,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,我没站稳
