Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.11,0:02:13.45,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,2000)\c&HF9DFBD&\1a&H37&\t(1300,1300,\c&HDEE6D3&)\t(2540,2540,\c&HF9DFBD&)}纵使心口刺痛 我仍要高声宣扬
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.57,0:02:19.04,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\1a&H4B&}我春日里遇见你
